00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:25.940
during that Fox News town hall along with
the other moderator, Martha Maccallum.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:31.920
Even that Bret Baier now admits when Mueller
spoke yesterday, he didn't say no collusion,

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:32.920
no obstruction.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:33.920
Now this is small.

